#  NOAA's own published tide predictions, captured for validation.
#
#  Source: https://api.tidesandcurrents.noaa.gov  product=predictions
#          interval=hilo  datum=MLLW  time_zone=gmt  units=metric
#  Works of the U.S. federal government: public domain.
#
#  These are the numbers the program has to reproduce. They are committed
#  rather than fetched so the check runs with no network, like everything
#  else here. Five regimes on purpose: two small New England ranges, a
#  mixed Pacific tide, a large Puget Sound tide, a big Gulf of Maine
#  range, and a diurnal Gulf coast station where there are only two turns
#  a day and the semidiurnal machinery has to get out of the way.
#
#  station | date | HH:MM,height,type ...
